      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TULHURST MAUREEN (3) scored a commanding win when fresh from a layoff last time out over 1730m at this track on August 19, finishing 12 metres ahead of her rivals. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. This doesn't look as hard so she is a major player again. ULTIMATE COOKIE (9) found some form last start when she found the lead and did well to go on and score by a neck at Parkes over 1660m. Will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane to play a big role. Finds a tougher race but another win is not out of the question. MAKE MINE MERICAN (4) resumes. Last appeared when a modest ninth over 1980m at Tamworth 17 months ago. MAISIELOUISA (6) is in the mix following a respectable third at her most recent appearance over 1660m at Parkes.",
